Third-party names and references
--------------------------------

This repository contains no third-party source code that is vendored or bundled. Dependencies are installed by
their own package managers (requirements*.txt, mc-bot/package.json) and keep
their own licences.

- The Trakteer reader (arti_donations.py) talks to an unofficial overlay protocol. Its comments cite two
  open-source client projects as references for that protocol, by project name: "trakteerdonate" (Python) and
  "trakteer-websocket-wrapper" (TypeScript), and a public gist about the media fields. The Saweria reader cites
  the open-source wrapper "saweria-api" (Node) the same way.
- The Minecraft POV adapter (mc-bot/pov.js) patches a separately installed third-party viewer bundle
  (prismarine-viewer, from mc-bot/package.json) in memory at runtime and serves it with the textures of that
  local install. This repository ships none of that bundle or its textures.
- Stardew Valley, SMAPI, VTube Studio, Minecraft, YouTube, Trakteer, Saweria, Streamlabs, OpenAI, Google and the
  other products and services this code talks to are trademarks or products of their owners. This project is not
  affiliated with any of them, and none of their assets are included.
